re confidence and visibility.</p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">We support consultants, architects, contractors, owners and developers, from Dubai projects to remote delivery for teams in the US, UK, Australia, Singapore and Europe. Our client feedback, open roles and articles are on the <a class=\"u\" href=\"/testimonials/\">testimonials</a>, <a class=\"u\" href=\"/careers/\">careers</a> and <a class=\"u\" href=\"/insights/\">insights</a> pages.</p>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:34px\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/bim-services/\">Our services <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/careers/\">Careers <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"ways\">\n    <div class=\"way rv\"><div><p class=\"lab\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Why ENGISOFT</p><h3 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Beyond <em>manpower supply.</em></h3></div><ul><li>Verified talent with assessment evidence</li><li>Technical assurance behind every placement</li><li>Workforce continuity built in</li></ul><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/why-engisoft/\">Why ENGISOFT <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n    <div class=\"way rv\"><div><p class=\"lab\">What we do</p><h3 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Staffing <em>and delivery.</em></h3></div><ul><li>BIM staffing: onsite, remote and dedicated teams</li><li>Engineering staffing by discipline</li><li>BIM services from modelling to QA/QC</li></ul><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/bim-staffing/\">BIM staffing <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Track record</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Trusted by leading <em>UAE firms.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Contractors, consultants and developers across the UAE and GCC.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"facts\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><div><b>400<sup>+</sup></b><span>Professionals deployed</span></div><div><b>250<sup>+</sup></b><span>Projects supported</span></div><div><b>3–9</b><span>Days from request to start</span></div><div><b>18</b><span>Specialist BIM &amp; engineering roles</span></div></div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:40px\"><div class=\"chiprow \"><span>ALEC</span><span>AMANA</span><span>Innovo</span><span>Bishop Design</span><span>ECC</span><span>Engineering Contracting</span><span>Killa Design</span><span>Kling Consult</span><span>Mirage</span><span>Obermeyer</span><span>Parsons</span><span>U+A</span><span>+ more across the UAE &amp; GCC</span></div></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"paper pad\" aria-label=\"Client testimonials\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Testimonials</p><h2 class=\"h2\">In our clients&rsquo; <em>words.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/testimonials/\">All testimonials <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div><div class=\"tst\"><figure class=\"tst-i rv\"><blockquote><p>I would like to express my sincere appreciation to ENGISOFT and their team for their efforts and seamless BIM services, complete BIM coordination and onsite BIM support.</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Mr. Amer</b><span>Project Manager, Al Jurf Development Project L.L.C.</span><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-services/bim-coordination/\">BIM Coordination</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tst-i rv\"><blockquote><p>ENGISOFT has met all its commitments and deadlines and provided us with quality BIM services with coordination. Hope to work with your team again soon.</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Mr. Jairaj</b><span>Project Manager, Gulf Prefab House Factory L.L.C.</span><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-services/bim-modeling/\">BIM Modeling</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"tst-i rv\"><blockquote><p>It was really nice working with ENGISOFT and its team on the Expo project for infrastructure and landscaping BIM modelling. We appreciate your effort and continuous support.</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Mr. Sarvana</b><span>Project Manager, Proscape L.L.C.</span><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-services/infrastructure-bim/\">Infrastructure BIM</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Inside the studio</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Where the <em>work happens.</em></h2></div></div>\n  <div class=\"gallery\">\n        <figure class=\"g1\"><img srcset=\"/assets/img/s-coord-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/s-coord.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" src=\"/assets/img/s-coord.jpg\" alt=\"Engineer coordinating an MEP model across two screens\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Coordination</figcaption></figure>\n        <figure><img srcset=\"/assets/img/architect-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/architect.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" src=\"/assets/img/architect.jpg\" alt=\"Architect marking up construction drawings by hand\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Design review</figcaption></figure>\n        <figure><img srcset=\"/assets/img/review-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/review.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" src=\"/assets/img/review.jpg\" alt=\"Two engineers reviewing a 3D model on a laptop\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Model review</figcaption></figure>\n        <figure><img srcset=\"/assets/img/onsite-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/onsite.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" src=\"/assets/img/onsite.jpg\" alt=\"Engineer in a hard hat reviewing a model on a tablet on site\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Onsite support</figcaption></figure>\n        <figure><img srcset=\"/assets/img/fins-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/fins.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 50vw\" src=\"/assets/img/fins.jpg\" alt=\"Concrete facade fins on a modern building\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Detail</figcaption></figure>\n      </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"where\"><img class=\"bg\" s